= Automated Accessibility Heuristic Auditing in CI
== Abstract
This study introduces a minimal accessibility audit bot that scores HTML artifacts using rules-based checks and trend reporting. It supports rapid feedback loops and transparent limitations.

== Method
Parse HTML snapshots and score rule violations with severity weighting.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
